  "gaps": [
    "The ID value is a conflict: Zephyr uses 0xCB and no-OS uses 0xC. They are consistent if 0xC is the upper nibble, but the datasheet is needed to say which bits are fixed.",
    "Register reset values, conversion times and the alert pin behavior are not in these driver headers; they need the datasheet.",
    "The Zephyr driver takes the I2C address from the devicetree, so the address straps rest on the no-OS header alone."
  ]
